        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Passively increase the Armor of Taric and any allied champion with Bastion.<br><br>Actively shields an ally and grants them Bastion for as long as they remain near Taric. Taric's spells also cast off the ally with Bastion.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive: </span>Taric gains <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">(6/7/8/9/10% Armor) Armor</span> and forms a tether between him and the ally bound by this Ability. As long as they are near each other, the ally gains <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">(6/7/8/9/10% Armor) Armor</span> and Taric casts all his Abilities from both himself and his linked ally.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Active: </span>Taric binds to an ally champion, granting a <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">7/8/9/10/11% max Health Shield</span> for 2.5 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Mimicked spell effects do not stack.</span><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Only one ally can be bound at a time. </span><br /><br />",
